---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const seo=[['endosfēra','4.8'],['vakuuma masāža','5.2'],['lāzerepilācija','6.1'],['лазерная эпиляция рига','6.4'],['lāzerepilācija vīriešiem','2.3'],['endosfera riga','1.5'],['laser hair removal riga','3.1']];
const related=[
['META ADS','2,970 enquiries in 8 months','Paid social acquisition through seasonality and changing demand.','/cases/epiline/meta-ads'],
['GOOGLE ADS','1,343 conversions','Capturing patients already searching for Epiline services.','/cases/epiline/google-ads'],
['SEO','From search to enquiries','Building non-branded visibility across Latvian and Russian.','/cases/epiline/seo'],
['WEBSITE','A complete rebuild','A new bilingual website built around services, search and conversion.','/cases/epiline/website'],
['CRM & BOOKING','Lead → appointment','Connecting Kommo CRM with Altegio to close the follow-up gap.','/cases/epiline/crm-booking']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Epiline case study | RM CREATIVES" description="How RM CREATIVES built Epiline's patient acquisition system across Meta Ads, Google Ads, SEO, website, CRM and online booking.">
<main><section class="hero shell"><div class="top eyebrow"><span>EPILINE / FULL-STACK GROWTH</span><span>RIGA · JURMALA</span></div><h1>One client.<br/>One system.<br/><em>Years of growth.</em></h1><div class="intro"><p>We’ve worked with Epiline since before RM CREATIVES existed as an agency. What began as hands-on marketing grew into a complete patient acquisition infrastructure.</p><div class="tags eyebrow">META ADS · GOOGLE ADS · SEO · WEBSITE · CRM · ONLINE BOOKING</div></div></section>
<section class="metrics"><div class="shell metric-grid"><div><strong>2,970</strong><span>Meta enquiries<br/>Jan–Aug 2026</span></div><div><strong>€5.85</strong><span>average<br/>Meta CPL</span></div><div><strong>1,343</strong><span>Google Ads conversions<br/>Jan–Aug 2026</span></div><div><strong>$5.35</strong><span>average<br/>Google Ads CPA</span></div></div></section>
<section class="story shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE PARTNERSHIP</span><div><h2>The relationship started<br/>before the agency.</h2><p class="lead">Our work with Epiline goes back to 2018–2019, when Ilya worked directly with the business as its marketer. When RM CREATIVES was formed, the project moved into the agency — and the relationship kept growing.</p><p>Instead of changing suppliers every time the business needed something new, we gradually built the infrastructure around it: advertising, search, organic acquisition, website, booking and CRM.</p><blockquote>One business. Multiple growth problems.<br/>One long-term partner.</blockquote></div></section>
<section class="channel dark"><div class="shell split"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / META ADS</span><h2>Predictable acquisition,<br/>not a lucky month.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>Between January and August 2026, campaigns generated <b>2,970 enquiries</b> at approximately <b>€5.85 weighted average CPL</b>.</p><a class="detail" href="/cases/epiline/meta-ads">EXPLORE META CASE →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="channel shell"><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / GOOGLE ADS</span><h2>Capture demand<br/>that already exists.</h2></div><div class="copy"><div class="big">1,343 <small>conversions</small></div><div class="big">$5.35 <small>weighted average CPA</small></div><a class="detail" href="/cases/epiline/google-ads">EXPLORE GOOGLE ADS CASE →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="seo"><div class="shell"><div class="seo-head"><span class="eyebrow">03 / SEO</span><h2>Demand you don’t have<br/>to buy every month.</h2><p>Organic visibility around real treatment demand in Latvian and Russian.</p></div><div class="rankings">{seo.map(([q,p])=><div><span>{q}</span><strong>#{p}</strong></div>)}</div><a class="detail" href="/cases/epiline/seo">EXPLORE SEO CASE →</a></div></section>
<section class="website shell"><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / WEBSITE · 2025</span><h2>We threw the old<br/>website away.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>In 2025 we built the current bilingual Epiline website from scratch, combining service architecture, SEO content and online booking into the conversion layer for paid and organic traffic.</p><a class="detail" href="/cases/epiline/website">EXPLORE WEBSITE CASE →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="crm dark"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">05 / CRM & ONLINE BOOKING</span><h2>A lead isn’t<br/>an appointment.</h2><div class="crm-grid"><div class="flow"><span>AD / WEBSITE</span><b>↓</b><span>LEAD</span><b>↓</b><span>KOMMO CRM</span><b>↓</b><span>FOLLOW-UP</span><b>↓</b><span>BOOKING</span><b>↓</b><span>ALTEGIO</span></div><div class="copy"><p>We connected Kommo CRM with Altegio so the team can manage potential patients before they become appointments — including calls, tasks, reminders and follow-up.</p><a class="detail light" href="/cases/epiline/crm-booking">EXPLORE CRM CASE →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="conclusion shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE SYSTEM</span><h2>The important number<br/>isn’t 2,970.</h2><p>The real result is that Epiline does not depend on a single acquisition channel. Meta brings demand. Google captures intent. SEO builds long-term visibility. The website converts traffic. Kommo manages potential patients. Altegio manages appointments.</p><div class="timeline"><strong>2018/19</strong><i></i><strong>2026</strong></div><h3>We didn’t run a campaign.<br/>We built the system around the business.</h3></section>
<section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED EPILINE CASES</span><h2>One client.<br/>Five deeper stories.</h2></div><div class="related-grid">{related.map(([tag,title,desc,href])=><a href={href}><span class="eyebrow">{tag}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p><span class="soon eyebrow">VIEW CASE →</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">BUILD THE SYSTEM</span><h2>Need more than<br/>another campaign?</h2><a href="/contact">Discuss a project ↗</a></section></main></BaseLayout>
<style>
